// Title: Arbitrary File Download Via MSEDGE_PROXY.EXE
// Rule ID: e84d89c4-f544-41ca-a6af-4b92fd38b023
// Severity: medium
// Tags: attack.defense-evasion, attack.execution, attack.t1218
// Category: process_creation
